{"t":"Gray Island","s":"gray-island-0ebf0","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Gray_Island_86051f.png","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Gray Island</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Gray Island\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"258\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gray_Island_86051f.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scrutinon\">Scrutinon</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.40<br/>December 14, 2011<br/>Winter Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Gray Island</b> is a small isle <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33189,31985,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">located (33189, 31985, 7)</a> south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> and west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a> which can only be reached by <a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">Boat</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> and Edron for 150 gp. On its surface one can find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sundial\">Sundial</a>, a hole and <a href=\"#/wiki/Scrutinon\">Scrutinon</a>, who will transport you back Ab'Dendriel, Darashia, Edron or Venore for free. There is an underground passage leading to <a href=\"#/wiki/Quirefang\">Quirefang</a> accessible through the only Hole in this island.\n</p><p>Gray Island was implemented at the Winter Update 2011.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Gray Island NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scrutinon\">Scrutinon</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scrutinon\"><img alt=\"Scrutinon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scrutinon_ead740.gif\" width=\"70\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Clairvoyant</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gray Island</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>","quests":["20-years-a-cook-quest","deeplings-world-change","hive-born-world-change","insectoid-outfits-quest","measuring-tibia-quest","opticording-sphere-quest","war-against-the-hive-quest"]}